      "text": "```\nCARBOHYDRATE SYSTEM — LAYERED VIEW\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nTAXONOMY LAYER:\n  Monosaccharides          Disaccharides           Polysaccharides\n  Glucose / Fructose /     Sucrose / Lactose /      Starch (amylose + amylopectin)\n  Galactose                Maltose                  Glycogen / Dietary Fiber"
